Table full name: bigquery-public-data.sec_quarterly_financials.numbers
Column name: submission_number Type: STRING Description: Accession Number. The 20-character string formed from the 18-digit number assigned by the Commission to each EDGAR submission. submission_number: [adsh]
Column name: company_name Type: STRING Description: Name of registrant from the submission table. This corresponds to the name of the legal entity as recorded in EDGAR as of the filing date.
Column name: measure_tag Type: STRING Description: The unique identifier (name) for a tag in a specific taxonomy release. measure_tag: [tag]
Column name: version Type: STRING Description: For a standard tag, an identifier for the taxonomy; otherwise the accession number where the tag was defined.
Column name: period_end_date Type: INT64 Description: The end date for the data value, rounded to the nearest month end. period_end_date: [ddate]
Column name: number_of_quarters Type: INT64 Description: The count of the number of quarters represented by the data value, rounded to the nearest whole number. \"0\" indicates it is a point-in-time value. number_of_quarters: [qtrs]
Column name: units Type: STRING Description: The unit of measure for the value. units: [uom]
Column name: dimension_hash Type: STRING Description: The 32-byte hexadecimal key for the dimensional information in the DIM data set. dimension_hash: [dimh]
Column name: iprx Type: INT64 Description: A positive integer to distinguish different reported facts that otherwise would have the same primary key. For most purposes, data with iprx greater than 1 are not needed. The priority for the fact based on higher precision, closeness of the end date to a month end, and closeness of the duration to a multiple of three months. See fields dcml, durp and datp below.
Column name: value Type: FLOAT64 Description: The value. This is not scaled, it is as found in the Interactive Data file, but is rounded to four digits to the right of the decimal point.
Column name: footnote Type: STRING Description: The plain text of any superscripted footnotes on the value, if any, as shown on the statement page, truncated to 512 characters.
Column name: footnote_length Type: INT64 Description: Number of bytes in the plain text of the footnote prior to truncation; zero if no footnote. footnote_length: [footlen]
Column name: num_dimensions Type: INT64 Description: Small integer representing the number of dimensions. Note that this value is a function of the dimension segments. num_dimensions: [dimn]
Column name: coregistrant Type: STRING Description: If specified, indicates a specific co-registrant, the parent company, or other entity (e.g., guarantor). NULL indicates the consolidated entity. Note that this value is a function of the dimension segments. coregistrant: [coreg]
Column name: duration_fraction Type: FLOAT64 Description: The difference between the reported fact duration and the quarter duration (qtrs), expressed as a fraction of 1. For example, a fact with duration of 120 days rounded to a 91-day quarter has a durp value of 29/91 = +0.3187. duration_fraction: [durp]
Column name: date_fraction Type: FLOAT64 Description: The difference between the reported fact date and the month-end rounded date (ddate), expressed as a fraction of 1. For example, a fact reported for 29/Dec, with ddate rounded to 31/Dec, has a datp value of minus 2/31 = -0.0645. date_fraction: [datp]
Column name: decimal Type: INT64 Description: The value of the fact \"decimals\" attribute, with INF represented by 32767. decimal: [dcml]
Column name: _PARTITIONTIME Type: TIMESTAMP
Sample rows:
[{'submission_number': '0000002178-14-000010', 'company_name': 'ADAMS RESOURCES & ENERGY, INC.', 'measure_tag': 'ProvedUndevelopedReserveVolume', 'version': 'us-gaap/2012', 'period_end_date': 20111231, 'number_of_quarters': 0, 'units': 'bbl', 'dimension_hash': '0x4b6210c8bc381142cdb473ce4f0dfc49', 'iprx': 0, 'value': 15000.0, 'footnote': '', 'footnote_length': 0, 'num_dimensions': 1, 'coregistrant': '', 'duration_fraction': 0.0, 'date_fraction': 0.0, 'decimal': -3}, {'submission_number': '0000002178-14-000010', 'company_name': 'ADAMS RESOURCES & ENERGY, INC.', 'measure_tag': 'CapitalizedCostsOilAndGasProducingActivitiesGross', 'version': 'us-gaap/2012', 'period_end_date': 20131231, 'number_of_quarters': 0, 'units': 'USD', 'dimension_hash': '0x00000000', 'iprx': 0, 'value': 98947000.0, 'footnote': '', 'footnote_length': 0, 'num_dimensions': 0, 'coregistrant': '', 'duration_fraction': 0.0, 'date_fraction': 0.0, 'decimal': -3}, {'submission_number': '0000002178-14-000010', 'company_name': 'ADAMS RESOURCES & ENERGY, INC.', 'measure_tag': 'GainLossOnSaleOfDerivatives', 'version': 'us-gaap/2012', 'period_end_date': 20121231, 'number_of_quarters': 4, 'units': 'USD', 'dimension_hash': '0x58dd9928a5056b801614ab21a7bf0b19', 'iprx': 0, 'value': 1338000.0, 'footnote': '', 'footnote_length': 0, 'num_dimensions': 1, 'coregistrant': '', 'duration_fraction': 0.0, 'date_fraction': 0.0, 'decimal': -3}, {'submission_number': '0000002178-14-000010', 'company_name': 'ADAMS RESOURCES & ENERGY, INC.', 'measure_tag': 'MarketingPropertyAndEquipment', 'version': '0000002178-14-000010', 'period_end_date': 20131231, 'number_of_quarters': 0, 'units': 'USD', 'dimension_hash': '0x00000000', 'iprx': 0, 'value': 52996000.0, 'footnote': '', 'footnote_length': 0, 'num_dimensions': 0, 'coregistrant': '', 'duration_fraction': 0.0, 'date_fraction': 0.0, 'decimal': -3}, {'submission_number': '0000002178-14-000010', 'company_name': 'ADAMS RESOURCES & ENERGY, INC.', 'measure_tag': 'DeferredIncomeTaxesAndOtherLiabilitiesNoncurrent', 'version': 'us-gaap/2012', 'period_end_date': 20131231, 'number_of_quarters': 0, 'units': 'USD', 'dimension_hash': '0x00000000', 'iprx': 0, 'value': 18664000.0, 'footnote': '', 'footnote_length': 0, 'num_dimensions': 0, 'coregistrant': '', 'duration_fraction': 0.0, 'date_fraction': 0.0, 'decimal': -3}]

