Table full name: bigquery-public-data.sec_quarterly_financials.calculation
Column name: submission_number Type: STRING Description: Accession Number. The 20-character string formed from the 18-digit number assigned by the Commission to each EDGAR submission. submission_number: [adsh]
Column name: group Type: INT64 Description: Sequential number for grouping arcs in a submission. group: [grp]
Column name: arc Type: INT64 Description: Sequential number for arcs within a group in a submission.
Column name: negative Type: INT64 Description: Indicates a weight of -1 (TRUE if the arc is negative), but typically +1 (FALSE).
Column name: parent_tag Type: STRING Description: The tag for the parent of the arc parent_tag: [ptag]
Column name: parent_version Type: STRING Description: The version of the tag for the parent of the arc parent_version: [pversion]
Column name: child_tag Type: STRING Description: The tag for the child of the arc child_tag: [ctag]
Column name: child_version Type: STRING Description: The version of the tag for the child of the arc child_version: [cversion]
Column name: _PARTITIONTIME Type: TIMESTAMP
